# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Clarity Mode — Frontend Production Environment Variables
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# This file documents the production environment variables for Vercel.
# Copy this to your Vercel project settings: https://vercel.com/dashboard
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ─── API Backend URL ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# NOT NEEDED — vercel.json rewrites /api/* → Railway backend automatically.
# No CORS issues because requests go to the same Vercel domain.
# VITE_API_URL=https://clarity-mode-app-v2-production.up.railway.app

# ─── Required: Supabase ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Get from: https://supabase.com/dashboard/project/_/settings/api
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# ─── Required: Public site URL ───────────────────────────────────────────────
VITE_SITE_URL=https://clarity-mode-app-v2-gg26.vercel.app